    "license": "cc-by-4.0",
    "description": "River discharge time series at 42 gauge stations across the Rhine river basin, containing multi-mission merged estimates produced by the Institute of Geodesy (GIS), University of Stuttgart, for EO4FLOOD. The basin-wide Parquet file identifies stations by gauge_name. time records timestamps, Q is estimated discharge in cubic metres per second, and Q_unc is the delivered uncertainty in the same units. gauge_lon and gauge_lat locate each station in geographic degrees. Sampling depends on the product and station; missing values indicate unavailable estimates and must not be interpreted as zero discharge.",
